  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1163292.svg\" alt=\"title\" width=\"386\" height=\"24\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>描述：</strong></span><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/linear pipes/screen.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;该资源包将来自&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pipez\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pipez</a>&nbsp;的所有管道方块模型与纹理进行更换，以提升视觉效果！</span></span><br><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Pretty X Smart Pipez/gif/with_text.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"634\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Pretty X Smart Pipez/image.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"634\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此外，本资源包还包含了 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pretty-pipez\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pretty Pipez</a> 中的所有物品。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Pretty X Smart Pipez/items.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"757\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;本项目将 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pretty-pipez\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pretty Pipez</a> 的模型与纹理同 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/smart-pipez\" rel=\"nofollow\">Smart Pipez</a> 的方块模型逻辑相结合。</span></p>",
